{"title":"Artificial Christmas Trees from $300 - $500","description":"\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExplore Our Collection of Artificial Christmas Trees from $300 - $500\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt King of Christmas, we believe that high-quality holiday décor should be accessible to everyone. Our collection of artificial Christmas trees priced between $300 and $500 offers the perfect blend of luxury, value, and style. These trees are carefully selected to provide a premium holiday experience without exceeding your budget. Whether you’re looking for a traditional green tree, a flocked masterpiece, or a pre-lit option, our $300 - $500 collection has something for every home.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePremium Features at an Affordable Price\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur $300 - $500 artificial Christmas trees are designed with the same attention to detail and quality as our more expensive models. Crafted from fire-resistant PVC and PE materials, these trees offer a lifelike appearance and durability that ensures they’ll be a cherished part of your holiday traditions for years to come. Choose from a variety of styles, including both green and flocked trees, to find the perfect tree that matches your holiday décor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConvenient Setup and Easy Storage\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSetting up your Christmas tree should be a joyful experience, not a chore. Our trees in this price range are designed for quick and easy assembly, with hinged branches and sturdy stands that ensure stability and ease of use. After the holidays, store your tree in a cool, dry place using the provided storage bag or box to keep it in pristine condition for next year.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCelebrate the Season with Style\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of the holidays into your home with a beautiful tree from our $300 - $500 collection. These trees offer the perfect combination of quality, style, and value, making them a popular choice for families who want to celebrate the season in style. Explore our collection and find the tree that will make your holiday season truly special.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"8-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"8' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 550 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"8' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642896379968,"sku":"PF-T8-L","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_5024a958-646c-4413-8cbb-72107e8ba72d.jpg?v=1714675448"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-queen-flock-tree-led","title":"6.5' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 750 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642897068096,"sku":"QF-T6.5-L","price":499.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/QueenFlock_7831fc2c-0c60-49cb-9368-a7127a8aaa1c.jpg?v=1722012623"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-queen-flock-tree-unlit","title":"7.5' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642897461312,"sku":"QF-T7.5-U","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-5.jpg?v=1718158615"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-king-flock-slim-tree-led","title":"6.5' King Flock® Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with 500 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":28642901524544,"sku":"KFS-T6.5-L","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingFlockSlim_d22f2bae-9586-452c-b63e-6bf6f63a60ad.jpg?v=1714673459"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-king-flock-slim-tree-led","title":"7.5' King Flock® Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with 650 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":28642901917760,"sku":"KFS-T7.5-L","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingFlockSlim_b2208eb9-116f-4bbb-8a55-3ac045ff327e.jpg?v=1714673454"},{"product_id":"9-foot-king-flock-slim-tree-unlit","title":"9' King Flock® Slim Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Slim \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642902081600,"sku":"KFS-T9-U","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-4_f294daff-b7c9-4c98-a20e-3d3c08a07b0b.jpg?v=1718159089"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-king-flock-tree-led","title":"6.5' King Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 600 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642903457856,"sku":"KF-T6.5-L","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\